0..67 Comment "// A migration\'s body checks under the row that its world requires."
68..70 Comment "//"
71..145 Comment "// A world\'s requirement states what code at the world may perform. So the"
146..217 Comment "// check refuses a body that performs outside that row, as it refuses a"
218..262 Comment "// function\'s body outside its declared row."
263..265 Comment "//"
266..345 Comment "// `unrequired` prints at `bare`, a world that requires nothing. The row of the"
346..424 Comment "// enclosing function holds the console, but that row does not reach the body."
425..500 Comment "// So the print is refused. `bound` binds the result of the same print to a"
501..551 Comment "// name, and the body of the migration is refused."
552..554 Comment "//"
555..629 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.gandr` — a migration printing"
630..678 Comment "//   through the console that its world requires"
680..712 Comment "// The console\'s host interface."
